        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84762?u=65f5941f516bf6a9c5be4be8dce0aadebb37690e&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This RFC describes an Extended Standard Library (ESL) for Rust.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Please see <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NzuF8QVVi9wcmvmHa1_-hwRLNb9UoxWNbUcdOsqWJyc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">this document</a> for additional information about fundraising.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I’d like to thank Dirkjan Ochtman (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/djc/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/djc\">@djc</a>), Adolfo Ochagavía (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/aochagavia/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/aochagavia\">@aochagavia</a>), Alex Gaynor (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/alex/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/alex\">@alex</a>), James Munns (OneVariable GmbH, <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/jamesmunns/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/jamesmunns\">@jamesmunns</a>), Andrew Gallant (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/BurntSushi/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/BurntSushi\">@BurntSushi</a>), Marco Ieni (<a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/marcoieni/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/marcoieni\">@marcoieni</a>), and many others for their feedback and assistance while working on this. My thanks does not necessarily imply their endorsement.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/bdaehlie/rust-rfcs/blob/extended-standard-library/text/0000-extended-standard-library.md\">Rendered</a></p>",
